      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-e/q3-solution-4.svg\" alt=\"6.5 + [(35 −24)/15] × 3 = 8.7. The handwritten median uses the width and frequency of a neighbouring class: The density there is 5, giving 6.5 + 11/5 = 8.7 h . [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
